===============================================================================
IMPORTANT: NON-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY WHEN RUN WITH TRIBEv2
===============================================================================

BrainX's brain-response predictions come from Meta's TRIBEv2 model. TRIBEv2's
code and weights are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

The MIT License on BrainX's own code does not grant any rights to TRIBEv2.
Running BrainX end to end uses TRIBEv2, so that use is limited to
non-commercial purposes unless you obtain other terms from Meta.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Meta TRIBEv2 (model code and weights)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/facebookresearch/tribev2
Weights: https://huggingface.co/facebook/tribev2
License: CC BY-NC 4.0

Not redistributed. setup_env.sh clones TRIBEv2 from GitHub at a pinned commit
and the weights are downloaded from HuggingFace at runtime.

patches/tribev2.patch contains excerpts of TRIBEv2 source code together with
BrainX's modifications (CPU WhisperX model choice, silero VAD, subprocess
retry and environment fixes, a numpy pin relaxation and a TemporalSmoothing
fix). As a derivative of TRIBEv2, that file is distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0,
not MIT. The changes are described in patches/tribev2-changes.md.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Models downloaded by TRIBEv2 at runtime
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TRIBEv2 fetches pretrained feature extractors from HuggingFace on first use.
None are redistributed here; each is governed by the licence on its model card.
Depending on the pathway used, these include:

  - meta-llama/Llama-3.2-3B (Llama 3.2 Community License; gated, you must
    accept Meta's terms on HuggingFace with the account behind HF_TOKEN)
  - facebook/w2v-bert-2.0
  - facebook/vjepa2-vitg-fpc64-256 (video pathway)
  - other encoders referenced by TRIBEv2's configuration

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. WhisperX (speech transcription)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/m-bain/whisperX
License: BSD 2-Clause

Invoked by TRIBEv2 through `uvx whisperx`; not redistributed. WhisperX
downloads its own Whisper and VAD models, each under its own licence.

