-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model:   https://replicate.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-vl2
Weights: DeepSeek-VL2, under the DeepSeek Model License
Used as a hosted service under Replicate's terms. Uploaded images are sent to
Replicate.

